        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that time, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", they shall bring out the bones of the kings of Judah, and the bones of his princes, and the bones of the priests, and the bones of the prophets, and the bones of the inhabitants of Jerusalem, out of their graves:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they shall spread them before the sun, and the moon, and all the host of heaven, whom they have loved, and whom they have served, and after whom they have walked, and whom they have sought, and whom they have worshipped: they shall not be gathered, nor be buried; they shall be for dung upon the face of the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And death shall be chosen rather than life by all the residue of them that remain of this evil family, which remain in all the places whither I have driven them, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Moreover thou shalt say unto them, Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Shall they fall, and not arise? shall he turn away, and not return?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "then",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is this people of Jerusalem slidden back by a perpetual backsliding? they hold fast deceit, they refuse to return.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hearkened and heard,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they spake not aright: no man repented him of his wickedness, saying, What have I done? every one turned to his course, as the horse rusheth into the battle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, the stork in the heaven knoweth her appointed times; and the turtle and the crane and the swallow observe the time of their coming; but my people know not the judgment of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How do ye say, We",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wise, and the law of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with us? Lo, certainly in vain made he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the pen of the scribes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in vain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are ashamed, they are dismayed and taken: lo, they have rejected the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; and what wisdom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in them?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore will I give their wives unto others,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their fields to them that shall inherit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for every one from the least even unto the greatest is given to covetousness, from the prophet even unto the priest every one dealeth falsely.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they have healed the hurt of the daughter of my people slightly, saying, Peace, peace; when",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no peace.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were they ashamed when they had committed abomination? nay, they were not at all ashamed, neither could they blush: therefore shall they fall among them that fall: in the time of their visitation they shall be cast down, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ I will surely consume them, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no grapes on the vine, nor figs on the fig tree, and the leaf shall fade; and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the things that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have given them shall pass away from them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why do we sit still? assemble yourselves, and let us enter into the defenced cities, and let us be silent there: for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.8.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.8.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our God hath put us to silence, and given us water of gall to drink, because we have sinned against the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.14",
